Tell2Adapt code release
=======================

This repository contains code derived from Microsoft BiomedParse v2
(https://github.com/microsoft/BiomedParse), which is licensed under the
Apache License 2.0. The Apache License 2.0 text is provided in LICENSE.

The CAPR implementation, prompt-injection pipeline, NPZ compatibility layer,
VPR implementation, tests, and documentation were added for the Tell2Adapt
project.

